=Analyze if this transcript teaches an actionable operational technique, prompt, or code pattern for an AI agent.

Title: {{ $json.title }}
Channel: {{ $json.channelName }}
Transcript Snippet:
{{ $json.transcript.slice(0, 15000) }}

Respond strictly with JSON:
{
  "is_teachable_skill": true/false,
  "skill_potential": 1-5,
  "category": "ai-coding|agents|rag|automation|general",
  "technique_description": "..."
}

